                                "sense_id": "e2935729-6a90-343a-8e61-c9ab1ed40277",
                                "text": "Her mother pours Tide into a bucket and gently handwashes the stained garment."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "366bfe3d-ce09-4d8c-b645-9fafa264fe3e",
                                "sense_id": "e2935729-6a90-343a-8e61-c9ab1ed40277",
                                "text": "She handwashed the crystal wineglasses we’d drunk from the night before."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "320d8343-f920-41ea-967e-76d00a897225",
                                "sense_id": "e2935729-6a90-343a-8e61-c9ab1ed40277",
                                "text": "After a while, Hannah sent Sadie out to bring in the clothes from the line, which they’d handwashed instead of taking over to the Stolfutzes. It worked almost as well, and it took less time than loading up and riding."
                            }
